# pos_flight.scn — POSITION_HOLD (vehicle_new, Layer 4, P8)
# 位置保持（vehicle_new, Layer 4, P8）
#
# Goal (Layer 4 gate): take off in STABILIZE, perturb the craft sideways with a brief
# roll step so it gains lateral velocity + displacement, then hand to POSITION_HOLD
# and verify the closed loop ARRESTS the drift and HOLDS the captured horizontal
# position (bounded px/py, no fly-away). POS_HOLD is the closed-loop validator for the
# optical-flow path: the position/velocity cascade reads the ESKF horizontal estimate
# (fed by PMW3901 flow with gyro compensation) and commands tilt to hold position.
# POS_HOLD implies ALT_HOLD, so altitude is held too.
# 目的（Layer 4 ゲート）: STABILIZE で離陸し、短いロールステップで横方向に擾乱を与えて
# 横速度＋変位を持たせ、POSITION_HOLD に渡して閉ループがドリフトを抑え捕捉水平位置を
# 保持する（px/py 有界・飛び去り無し）ことを検証する。POS_HOLD はオプティカルフロー経路の
# 閉ループ検証器（位置/速度カスケードが ESKF 水平推定＝PMW3901 フロー＋ジャイロ補償を読み
# 傾きで位置保持）。POS_HOLD は ALT_HOLD を含むので高度も保持。
#
# Sticks are raw 12-bit ADC, centre 2048. In POS_HOLD the throttle stick is the
# climb-rate command (centre = norm 0.5 = raw 3072 → hold altitude) and the roll/pitch
# sticks are OVERRIDDEN by the position cascade. pos token = optional 6th rc field.
# スティックは raw 12bit ADC（中央2048）。POS_HOLD では throttle は上昇率（中央=raw3072=高度
# 保持）、roll/pitch は位置カスケードが上書き。pos トークン = rc の任意6番目。
#
#  <t>  ch  <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz> <alt> <acro> <pos>
   0    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     4000      50                       # A: disarmed 4 s → IDLE_GROUND
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  1     1000      50                       # B: ARM, idle 1 s
   +    rc   3330  2048   2048    2048  1     2000      50                       # C: STABILIZE take-off, climb ~2 s
   +    rc   3290  2600   2048    2048  1     600       50                       # C2: roll-right step (~+8°) 0.6 s → lateral drift (gains +East velocity)
   +    rc   3072  2048   2048    2048  1     14000     50        0     0     1  # D: POS_HOLD (pos=1) — arrest drift + hold position & altitude 14 s
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     1000      50                       # E: DISARM (motors cut)
#
# STATUS (P8, WIP — POS_HOLD MARGINALLY HOLDS, ~7 s then drifts): the root cause of the
# earlier tumble/runaway was found and fixed (commit 98dd05f) — the ESKF accel-attitude
# update was hard-gated during the tilt+accelerate maneuver, so it estimated "level"
# (est_roll +5°) while the craft was rolled to -48°, and the attitude loop over-rolled
# into a tumble. Converging to the proven firmware/vehicle config (no norm gate,
# k_adaptive=10) makes est_roll TRACK truth; the craft now holds position for ~7 s and
# the worst-case horizontal runaway dropped from ~371 m to ~51 m. The remaining issue is
# a slow drift after ~7 s (a few-degree est_roll bias accumulates) — tuning room, the
# same "marginally holds" regime as the old firmware. NOT yet a hard gate.
# ステータス（P8, WIP — POS_HOLD は約7秒 marginal 保持後に緩ドリフト）: 以前のタンブル/暴走の
# 真因を特定・修正済(commit 98dd05f) — ESKF の加速度-姿勢更新が傾斜+加速マニューバ中に
# ハードゲートされ「水平」(est_roll +5°)と誤推定(真 roll -48°)→姿勢ループが過剰ロール→タンブル。
# 実証済み firmware/vehicle 構成(norm gate無し・k_adaptive=10)へ収束で est_roll が真値追従、
# 約7秒位置保持・水平暴走 371m→51m。残=約7秒後の緩ドリフト(est_roll 数度バイアス蓄積)＝旧版同様
# の「marginal hold・調整余地」。まだ厳密ゲートではない。
# （フローの「位置保持」は実質「速度保持」）。
#
# No .expect: this scenario is the Layer 4 reproduction/diagnosis harness (not yet a gate).
